    <briefdescription>
<para>This class wraps a std::error_code in a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_error" kindref="compound">Error</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is useful if you&apos;re writing an interface that returns a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_error" kindref="compound">Error</ref> (or <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_expected" kindref="compound">Expected</ref>) and you want to call code that still returns std::error_codes. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
